小领通

This independent application adapts XiaomiLink, BandService, the Android/Vela build
scaffolding and SDK/signing preparation from zjs215/geely-band-control,
https://github.com/zjs215/geely-band-control/tree/a234b00b8e095aa41cb43d451d52cd59f2ec2809
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE.
Modifications include a distinct identity and signing setup, a Lynk & Co widget
host, phone and wrist user interfaces, control protocol and tests.

The Gradle Wrapper retains its upstream notices. The Xiaomi Wearable SDK included
in the local Android build is subject to Xiaomi's terms. The build downloads the
pinned AAR from the official sample and checks its SHA-256. The Android and Vela
toolchains and their dependencies retain their original licenses. The official
Lynk & Co application and its widget resources are supplied by the owner’s
installed application and are not included in this project.
